1
00:00:10,388 --> 00:00:12,604
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,611 --> 00:00:16,757
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,804 --> 00:00:19,303
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,157 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,457 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,703 --> 00:00:30,105
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,845 --> 00:00:37,165
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,139 --> 00:00:40,392
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,252 --> 00:00:43,912
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,605 --> 00:00:47,072
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,885 --> 00:00:50,203
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,177 --> 00:00:53,563
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,317
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,613 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,853 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,813
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,005 --> 00:01:07,405
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,445 --> 00:01:08,691
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,098 --> 00:01:10,471
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,498 --> 00:01:13,877
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,903 --> 00:01:17,037
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,557
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,723
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,764 --> 00:01:26,977
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,017 --> 00:01:29,037
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,517
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,064 --> 00:01:36,118
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,131 --> 00:01:39,597
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,644 --> 00:01:41,877
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,231 --> 00:01:45,724
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,874 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,557 --> 00:01:56,997
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 3=

34
00:02:14,353 --> 00:02:18,392
(Half a Quarter of an Hour Earlier)

35
00:02:18,466 --> 00:02:20,939
(Steamed Cakes)

36
00:02:22,826 --> 00:02:23,433
(Steamed Cakes)

37
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:25,840
So this is how you make a living?

38
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:31,400
I used to tell fortunes
and read people's faces.

39
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,360
Don't worry, my dear.

40
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:33,640
Once I make some money,

41
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,160
I'll buy you some meat pies.

42
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:40,560
What I eat doesn't matter.

43
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,680
What's important is

44
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,680
that you remember what I told you.

45
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:46,040
When the great tide arrives,

46
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:48,240
use it to raise a huge wave
and overcome your tribulation.

47
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:51,040
If they dare strike you
with heavenly lightning,

48
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:53,600
the waves will crash into Lin'an City,

49
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,120
and countless people will die.

50
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,560
But with humanity's fortune
in your hands,

51
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,760
they won't dare act recklessly.

52
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,760
Once you survive the tribulation

53
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:02,880
and become a true dragon,

54
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:06,160
the Three Realms will belong to you.

55
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,560
You and I

56
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:10,240
can finally be together forever.

57
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,880
When I rule the Three Realms,

58
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,600
I'll cure your illness,

59
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,680
and then, my dear,

60
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,240
we can eat whatever we want.

61
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:26,240
You're nothing but a lowly shoe shiner,

62
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,720
and you think you can rule
the Three Realms?

63
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,720
If you're really a true dragon,

64
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,680
then I'm the Jade Emperor himself!

65
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:44,600
The great tide is here.

66
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,080
Ah!

67
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,160
Later,

68
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:02,520
I'll eat you first.

69
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:06,560
Wow!

70
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,760
What a bustling city.

71
00:04:16,903 --> 00:04:18,117
(He's General Store
Qingyun Bamboo Workshop)

72
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,080
Hurry up!

73
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,200
Master.

74
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:33,160
Master, save me!

75
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,520
Om Mani Padme Hum!

76
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,080
Seal!

77
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,800
You leave me no choice.

78
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,000
Come back!

79
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:05,840
Oh, Biqing!

80
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,320
(General Store; Qingyun Bamboo Workshop)
Biqing!

81
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,120
Biqing!

82
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:11,800
Biqing!

83
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:13,720
Master Guangliang!

84
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,160
I missed you so much!

85
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:16,600
Pah!

86
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,720
Flatterer!

87
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:18,880
Hey.

88
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:19,520
Master.

89
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,000
Huh?

90
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,520
Who's this dummy?

91
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,600
Him?

92
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,440
Me?

93
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,480
I'm loved by everyone.

94
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,080
And I'm so charming

95
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:25,720
I could stop traffic.

96
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,800
I'm Lingyin Temple's resident
heartthrob

97
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,960
and my master's favorite sidekick.

98
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,480
My Dharma name is Bixu.

99
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:31,920
Xu.

100
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,040
As your senior,

101
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:33,600
let me ask you something.

102
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,560
Why does Master Guangliang like me
so much?

103
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,680
Because I'm smart,

104
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,240
cheerful,

105
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:38,840
brave, confident,

106
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,440
mature, graceful,

107
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,360
optimistic, calm, talented, kind,

108
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:40,760
handsome, adorable,

109
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,240
hardworking, strong,

110
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:41,720
thoughtful,

111
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,360
upright, admirable,

112
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:42,800
dignified,

113
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:43,240
positive, cheerful,

114
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:43,640
kind-hearted,

115
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:44,120
polite,

116
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,040
and impressive.

117
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:45,880
Wake up. Wake up.

118
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,080
So as your senior,

119
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:49,040
I must tell you,

120
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,000
take good care of

121
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,400
- the temple overseer's every need.
- Mm-hmm.

122
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:54,360
Whatever Master Guangliang
asks you to do,

123
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,320
just say,

124
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,280
"Absolutely."

125
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:56,840
Got it?

126
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:57,960
Absolutely.

127
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:58,560
Say it.

128
00:05:58,880 --> 00:05:59,680
Absolutely!

129
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,800
- Good.
- He's good at it!

130
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,600
Master!

131
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,360
Hey, move aside.

132
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,760
Master!

133
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,640
Oh.

134
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,320
My turn.

135
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,640
- Hey.
- Master Daoji.

136
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,960
Looks like someone is losing favor.

137
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,440
Fine.

138
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,040
You all look down on me.

139
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,400
Then from today on,

140
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,320
I officially quit
the Lingyin Temple team.

141
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:22,680
Huh?

142
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:23,360
Hmph.

143
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:25,520
That might not be so bad.

144
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:26,320
- Great!
- Great!

145
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,920
Saves us a meal!

146
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,000
- One less mouth to feed.
- Exactly.

147
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:29,960
- See?
- Of course it's great!

148
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,200
Now that you've quit,

149
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:36,480
I'm Master Daoji's number-one sidekick!

150
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,000
I can't go on living!

151
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:39,720
Fine!

152
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,720
You won't let me live,

153
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:42,760
so let Heaven decide.

154
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,680
Let's all die together!

155
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:52,080
No, no.

156
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:52,960
I'm just kidding.

157
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:53,720
Amitabha Buddha!

158
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,320
Master!

159
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:55,160
The Three-Headed Jiao!

160
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,680
Him again?

161
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,440
Don't be afraid.

162
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,000
I've fought him before.

163
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,280
I took him down in no time.

164
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,920
I'll deal with him again!

165
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,200
- Wait, wait, Master!
- Master!

166
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,480
If you rush in now,

167
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,800
with waves this huge,

168
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,120
won't Lin'an City suffer?

169
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:09,760
Ah!

170
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:10,720
Besides, Master,

171
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,120
if this flood really comes
crashing down,

172
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,480
your wages today will be wasted.

173
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,800
That's what really matters.

174
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:15,800
- Master.
- What should we do?

175
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,920
The Three-Headed Jiao
secretly practiced

176
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,040
Buddhist teachings
at Master Bala's temple

177
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:19,960
and has a connection with Buddhism.

178
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:22,520
- Yeah.
- That's why Bala brought you this.

179
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,240
- Wow!
- Only this treasure can subdue him.

180
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:26,120
Hurry up and show me!

181
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:26,680
Coming right up.

182
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,240
- Ah?
- Hah!

183
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:33,320
Where did you pull that from?

184
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:37,440
Isn't this

185
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:40,280
Li Jing's pagoda,
the Heavenly King's treasure?

186
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:41,080
How did you get it?

187
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:41,440
Well,

188
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:42,680
let's not worry about that now.

189
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,800
Use it

190
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,360
to deal with him first.

191
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,840
We'll hide back at Lingyin Temple.

192
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:46,920
Alright.

193
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,000
Go, go!

194
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:52,920
Hmph.

195
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,560
You thief.

196
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,240
I spared you last time,

197
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,160
and now you dare

198
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:58,480
flood Lin'an City?

199
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,360
No,

200
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,360
you've got it wrong.

201
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,800
Thanks to your blessing,

202
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,240
I found the woman I was destined
to meet.

203
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:03,960
But...

204
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:04,400
Huh?

205
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,720
she's seriously ill.

206
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,560
I must become a true dragon

207
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:10,000
and save her with my dragon blood.

208
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:12,600
What kind of illness needs
dragon blood to cure?

209
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:14,440
Wouldn't some loofah stew do the trick?

210
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,040
Hmm.

211
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,880
Don't let yourself be fooled.

212
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:17,400
Impossible.

213
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,520
My dear would never lie to me.

214
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,840
Ask her if you don't believe me.

215
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:25,840
Hmph.

216
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:26,880
I'll catch her.

217
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:39,920
Darling!

218
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,320
Come on!

219
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,240
Darling?

220
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,200
Let me tell you,

221
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:46,200
your destined woman

222
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,320
is her.

223
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:49,800
Me?

224
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:50,600
Yeah, you forgot?

225
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,200
It was arranged.

226
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,520
Right.

227
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:55,400
I'm actually your destined woman.

228
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,720
Don't believe that snake demon's lies.

229
00:08:58,760 --> 00:08:59,840
Don't try to fool me.

230
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,880
You and I aren't even the same species.

231
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:03,280
How could we ever have children?

232
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,920
That's true.

233
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:09,040
Looks like you're forcing me
to subdue you.

234
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:09,560
Good.

235
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:11,920
If you capture me,

236
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,440
then watch Lin'an City drown.

237
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,840
Right. How could I forget?

238
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,880
Fine. You win.

239
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,440
You monster,

240
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:19,840
withdraw the river waters!

241
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,160
Or I'll kill her.

242
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,360
Whoever dares stop
my benefactor's tribulation,

243
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,200
I will kill them.

244
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,160
Piaopiao.

245
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:28,880
Let her go.

246
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,040
Or I'll kill you!

247
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:33,560
Daoji!

248
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,800
How dare you steal my Linglong Pagoda?

249
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,000
Give it back now!

250
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:39,080
Or I'll kill her!

251
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:39,920
Hey, Li.

252
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:41,080
We're colleagues, aren't we?

253
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,920
I borrowed your pagoda to subdue demons.

254
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,160
Why are you in such a hurry?

255
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,000
Hmph. You old fool.

256
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,800
Today is your last day.

257
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,160
Daoji.

258
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,520
Now do you understand?

259
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,200
Oh, fine.

260
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:54,440
What do you want?

261
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:54,920
I...

262
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:55,800
I don't know.

263
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,120
I want wealth and glory.

264
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,360
I want endless riches.

265
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:00,040
Or I'll kill this child.

266
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:00,920
But first,

267
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,480
I'll kill this old man.

268
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:03,320
Hmph.

269
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,360
Daoji,

270
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:05,640
before I die,

271
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,880
I'll take your people down with me.

272
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,120
Let her go!

273
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,880
Whoever dares stop my benefactor,

274
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:11,680
I will kill them!

275
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,280
Master, hurry and act!

276
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:16,440
My dear, don't fear them.

277
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,360
Complete your tribulation!

278
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,360
This useless monk

279
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,920
can't stop the river.

280
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,680
He doesn't even dare fight you!

281
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:23,280
Okay.

282
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:35,680
Oh no.

283
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,800
The heavenly thunder is coming.

284
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:40,440
If my husband is struck
by heavenly lightning,

285
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,040
you'll all die soon enough!

286
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,360
If I don't enter hell,

287
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:47,160
who will?

288
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,320
Master!

289
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,640
That foolish monk

290
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:02,120
used his own life to block
the heavenly lightning.

291
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:04,800
Once my husband completes
his tribulation,

292
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:07,120
you'll all die.

293
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,560
With the power of the Thunder God,

294
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,520
I feel like

295
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:25,480
I'm overflowing with power!

296
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,120
True

297
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:31,600
Lightning Punch.

298
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:42,240
Om Mani Padme Hum!

299
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,000
Seal!

300
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,040
Master!

301
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:05,080
Ah!

302
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:11,280
Go!

303
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,880
Seal!

304
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,120
Ah!

305
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,640
Your mom's calling you home for dinner!

306
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:52,320
Okay!

307
00:12:57,280 --> 00:13:00,440
Careful, I might spill your
little secret.

308
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:00,880
What?

309
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:01,840
No, don't!

310
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:04,720
Hey.

311
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:05,680
Hey.

312
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,560
Let me tell you.

313
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,280
With his weakness in my hands,

314
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:15,520
I won't have to carry that tower
every day anymore.

315
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:17,280
No more worrying about shoulder pain!

316
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,040
I haven't settled the score
with you yet.

317
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:27,560
True dragon's blood?

318
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,000
Hey.

319
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:33,680
Hmph.

320
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:36,960
The thing I hate most is a female liar.

321
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,000
Pah!

322
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,160
Hmm?

323
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:40,160
Hmm.

324
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,200
Keep the pagoda for now.

325
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:42,640
We'll meet again in Heaven another day.

326
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:45,400
Go!

327
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:46,840
Alas.

328
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:48,760
You too.

329
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:50,960
Holy Monk.

330
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,400
The Three-Headed Jiao is kind by nature.

331
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:55,000
Yesterday, he even paid money
to save me from hunters.

332
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:57,160
He was deceived by
that snake demon just now.

333
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:59,520
My benefactor only wished to save her.

334
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:01,320
He never intended to harm anyone.

335
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:03,160
Please spare his life, Holy Monk.

336
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:06,240
But he nearly destroyed
all of Lin'an City.

337
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,760
How could I possibly let him go?

338
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,360
But you...

339
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:12,040
You were only repaying a debt
of gratitude.

340
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:14,160
You have committed no grave wrong.

341
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:15,480
Leave.

342
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:28,360
(Monk.)

343
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:30,200
(I have good news for you.)

344
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,480
(Could you let me out now?)

345
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:33,880
Oh, you still want to bargain?

346
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:35,360
Spit it out.

347
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,960
(The moment you struck me just now,)

348
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,040
(I saw you)

349
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:40,720
(reuniting with someone from your past,)

350
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:41,680
(someone you once shared feelings with.)

351
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:43,840
Ah!

352
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:44,400
Yan...

353
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:45,920
Yanzhi...

354
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:51,840
(Xiuyuan.)

355
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:54,320
Who is Yanzhi?

356
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:55,760
Kids shouldn't ask too many questions!

357
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:58,920
Hey, I've already cut off
all worldly attachments.

358
00:14:58,920 --> 00:14:59,920
Since

359
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,760
you have a connection with Buddha,

360
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:04,240
I'll let you stay inside the pagoda
for now

361
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,680
to continue reflecting on your mistakes.

362
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,360
Master.

363
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:10,720
Yes?

364
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,640
You're really fierce today.

365
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:13,240
Yeah.

366
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,560
Is your inner heat acting up?

367
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,040
How about...

368
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:18,200
some loofah stew?

369
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:21,440
I was just pretending.

370
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:25,280
- Help me back quickly.
- Sure.

371
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,520
(Fate blesses me.)

372
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:52,040
(The Linglong Pagoda's spiritual energy
has entered me.)

373
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:54,600
(I can finally escape!)

374
00:16:01,230 --> 00:16:04,143
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

375
00:16:04,590 --> 00:16:07,403
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

376
00:16:07,550 --> 00:16:11,201
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

377
00:16:11,248 --> 00:16:14,227
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

378
00:16:14,687 --> 00:16:21,439
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

379
00:16:21,459 --> 00:16:24,992
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

380
00:16:31,703 --> 00:16:34,903
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

381
00:16:34,930 --> 00:16:38,156
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

382
00:16:38,450 --> 00:16:41,470
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

383
00:16:41,483 --> 00:16:43,163
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

384
00:16:43,197 --> 00:16:45,076
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

385
00:16:45,117 --> 00:16:46,643
♪I left my wife behind♪

386
00:16:46,783 --> 00:16:48,243
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

387
00:16:48,283 --> 00:16:52,059
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

388
00:16:52,119 --> 00:16:53,199
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

389
00:16:53,212 --> 00:16:55,299
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

390
00:16:55,339 --> 00:16:56,999
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

391
00:16:57,039 --> 00:16:58,865
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

392
00:16:58,899 --> 00:17:02,232
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

393
00:17:02,266 --> 00:17:05,499
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

394
00:17:05,752 --> 00:17:08,626
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

395
00:17:08,652 --> 00:17:12,001
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

396
00:17:12,048 --> 00:17:15,661
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

397
00:17:15,707 --> 00:17:19,007
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

398
00:17:19,048 --> 00:17:22,117
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

399
00:17:22,703 --> 00:17:25,750
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

400
00:17:25,770 --> 00:17:29,190
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

401
00:17:29,230 --> 00:17:32,754
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

402
00:17:32,767 --> 00:17:36,234
♪You're just wasting your time♪

403
00:17:36,281 --> 00:17:39,201
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

404
00:17:39,248 --> 00:17:40,861
♪And I just laugh happily♪

405
00:17:40,888 --> 00:17:44,267
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

406
00:17:52,992 --> 00:17:56,545
